<title>DOMINICAN REPUBLIC: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>DOMINICAN REPUBLIC GOVERNMENT LIST (961114)</p>
<p> President................................... Leonel FERNANDEZ</p>
<p>(Sworn in 16 Aug 96 for four-year term)</p>
<p> Vice-President..........................Jaime David FERNANDEZ</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT:</p>
<p>SECRETARIES OF STATE (MINISTERS)</p>
<p> Agriculture..................................Frank RODRIIGUEZ</p>
<p> Armed Forces........................Gen Ruben Paulino ALVAREZ</p>
<p> Attorney General.....................Abel Rodriiguez DEL ORBE</p>
<p>Director of the Corporation of State</p>
<p>    Enterprises.......................Euclides Gutierrez FELIZ</p>
<p> Education.........................Ligia Amado Melo DE CARDONA</p>
<p> Finance........................................Daniel TORIBIO</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs...............................Eduardo LATORRE</p>
<p> Industry &amp; Commerce...................... Luis Manuel BONETTI</p>
<p> Interior &amp; Police...............................Norge BOTELLO</p>
<p> Labour....................................Rafael ALBURQUERQUE</p>
<p> Legal Counsel to the Executive Office......Cesar Pina TORIBIO</p>
<p> Public Health &amp; Social Assistance..............Erasmo VASQUEZ</p>
<p> Public Works..................................Herman HERNANDO</p>
<p> Secretary of the Presidency.....................Danilo MEDINA</p>
<p> Administrative Secretary of the Presidency.....Diandino PENA</p>
<p>Press Director for the presidency,</p>
<p>  with the rank of Secretary of State..........Miguel GUERRERO</p>
<p>  Technical Secretary of the Presidency........Eduardo SEELMAN</p>
<p> Sports..........................................Juan MARICHAL</p>
<p> Tourism.........................................Felix JIMENEZ</p>
<p> Without portfolio.................................Lidio CADET</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor......................Mario READ-VITTINI</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
